1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
Find the rat.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,000
You mean… the noticeboard?

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Our route got exposed.

4
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Check what you can see.

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Notice at the docks.

6
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Foundry copy matches.

7
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,500
Two screenshots. Solved.

8
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,000
Two independent sources.

9
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Disclosure. Not guilt.

10
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,000
He has a private report.

11
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,500
His. You can’t read it.

12
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,000
Form the operation.

13
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,500
I’ll bring the seal.

14
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,000
I’ll bring the evidence.

15
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,500
Your boss still approves.

16
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Document the disclosure.

17
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,500
So nobody’s the rat?

18
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,000
You haven’t proved that.

19
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,500
And the city keeps this?

20
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,000
The consequence. Yes.

21
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,500
OMERTÀ.

22
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,000
Bring receipts.
